  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Concealed Carry Hoodie is the ultimate sweatshirt that incorporates the best of both worlds by offering best-in-class discrete carry options while providing unbeatable warmth and comfort. The tactical hoodie is perfect for active and off-duty professionals, outdoorsmen, everyday use, and more. Whether you're heading out for a day on the range, working in public safety, or just running errands around town, this hoodie has everything you need to stay comfortable and prepared.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3166",
  "description": "<p>Our Concealed Carry Hoodie is the ultimate sweatshirt that incorporates the best of both worlds by offering best-in-class discrete carry options while providing unbeatable warmth and comfort. The tactical hoodie is perfect for active and off-duty professionals, outdoorsmen, everyday use, and more. Whether you're heading out for a day on the range, working in public safety, or just running errands around town, this hoodie has everything you need to stay comfortable and prepared.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Discrete &amp; Fast:&nbsp;</strong>The passthrough kangaroo pocket allows for quick and easy access to your IWB items for appendix carry. In addition, the 8.25 inch internal vertical access point ensures that most standard EDC essentials will fit comfortably.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Staying Cool and Dry:</strong>Made of 100% polyester, these CCW hoodies wick sweat and moisture away for optimum comfort. Featuring our rapid moisture control fabric, sweat is swiftly transferred to the top layer, allowing for a quick dry. This prevents sweat from soaking through the moisture-wicking hoodie and back into your undershirt, allowing you to move freely without your clothing sticking to you. These comfortable hoodies are perfect for both normal everyday wear and for those who work in public safety.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Secure Storage:</strong>The pullover hoodie also features two zippered sleeve pockets with wire passthrough ports, allowing you to safely tuck away your phone, wallet, or other everyday carry items. The right sleeve includes a dual pen pocket for keeping writing utensils, while the left sleeve features a loop panel for adding morale and flag patches.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Warm &amp; Comfortable:&nbsp;</strong>With a soft fleece lining, these pullover hooded sweatshirts offer all-day (and all-night) comfort. The drawstring hood keeps your head and neck warm while protecting you against cold wind and rain. The built-in thumbholes preserve your hands&rsquo; heat without sacrificing your mobility and range of motion.</p>\n<p>Rothco stands out as the leader in concealed carry clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective CCW gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of specialized concealed carry items. From public safety and military personnel, to privately armed citizens, Rothco is the go-to brand for concealed carry apparel and gear.</p>",
